<title>USA: Shell gets $293.3 mln US contract.</title>
<headline>Shell gets $293.3 mln US contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Oil Co of Houston, Texas, a unit of Royal Dutch/Shell Group, has received a $293.3 million U.S. defense contract for jet fuel, the Pentagon's Defense Logistics Agency said on Thursday.</p>
